  "comments": "Three varieties of 1944 C are known.<br />\r\n1. Variety small C. The small C was done by using the awl of the 50 centimes Vichy 1944 C.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/654e130b69ec3.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/654e130b69ec3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2. Large C is known in 2 main positions of the letter:<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">I</span> - &#039;C&#039; far from ax.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">II</span> - &#039;C&#039; near ax. The discovery coin was published on 5, February 2016.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5dbd688842116.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5dbd688842116.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"185\" height=\"250\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5cf6a65a85a93.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5cf6a65a85a93.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"142\" /></a>",
